THIRD-PARTY CODE AND DATA
Norn is not a Mutable Instruments product and is not endorsed by Mutable Instruments. The waveshaper in ws_dsp.h is
an integer port of Plaits' waveshaping engine (plaits/dsp/engine/waveshaping_engine.cc and
plaits/dsp/oscillator/oscillator.h, with stmlib's integrated BLEP and Hermite interpolation); the FM in fm_dsp.h is
an integer port of Plaits' FM engine (plaits/dsp/engine/fm_engine.cc and plaits/dsp/oscillator/sine_oscillator.h);
the formant model in gr_dsp.h is an integer port of Plaits' grain engine (plaits/dsp/engine/grain_engine.cc and
plaits/dsp/oscillator/grainlet_oscillator.h); wave terrain in wt_dsp.h is an integer port of Plaits' wave terrain
engine (plaits/dsp/engine2/wave_terrain_engine.cc); and the tables in ws_tables.h, fm_tables.h and wt_tables.h are
generated (gen_tables.py) from Plaits' plaits/resources.cc (wt_waves: its wav_integrated_waves),
